rectX\u00ae","9.0c"],["Sound","Sound card with DirectX 9.0c support"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"The factory deal is done, yet Kate Walker's journey is far from over. Instead of going home, she joins the elderly, eccentric Hans Voralberg on his long-running quest to track down the last surviving mammoths of legend, in a forgotten land called Syberia. Dangers along the way test the pair far more than anything before.\n\nLike the first game, it is a single-player adventure built around exploration, dialogue and puzzle solving. Playing the original first makes the story easier to follow, and the sequel suits those who enjoy deliberate, story-led adventures with a surreal, storybook quality."}}